---
// v2/src/components/pace/Statement.astro
---

<section id="statement" class="py-24 sm:py-36 bg-[#f6f7f9] border-y border-[#e2e5eb]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16 sm:mb-24">
      <span class="eyebrow block mb-4 text-[#ff5a1f]">The Screenless Advantage</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[0.92] text-[#0c0e12]">
        No screen. No noise. Only signal.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#5e6777] leading-relaxed">
        Smartwatches turned our wrists into miniature phones. PACE does the opposite: it fades into the background so you can focus on living, training, and resting.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Core Tenets Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="tenet-card bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2e5eb] shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#0c0e12] opacity-20 block mb-6">01</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#0c0e12] mb-3">Zero Interruption</h3>
        <p class="text-[#5e6777] leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          No notifications, no buzzing vibrations, no glowing screen when you turn your wrist. Complete uninterrupted focus during workouts and sleep.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="tenet-card bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2e5eb] shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#0c0e12] opacity-20 block mb-6">02</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#0c0e12] mb-3">Indestructible Shell</h3>
        <p class="text-[#5e6777] leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          Forged from Grade 5 titanium alloy with an IP68 and 10 ATM waterproof rating. Built for brutal ocean swims, gravel descents, and rugged trail runs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="tenet-card bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2e5eb] shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#00d984] block mb-6">03</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#0c0e12] mb-3">No Monthly Fee</h3>
        <p class="text-[#5e6777] leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          One transparent price. Every metric, sleep stage analysis, heart rate variability trend and cardiovascular load insight is included forever.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tenet-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: #cbd2dc;
  }
</style>
